455^8:trailers;0:~7:content;2050:{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan: Write Tests for export_flows.py\n\n## Context\nThe file `/workspace/export_flows.py` (1430 lines) exports mitmproxy flow files into structured per-flow directories and performs token usage analysis. The user wants a comprehensive pytest suite at `/workspace/evaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py` achieving ‚â•80% code coverage. No existing tests, no pytest config. mitmproxy is an external dependency requiring mocking.\n\n## Target file\n`/workspace/export_flows.py` ‚Äî imported as `export_flows` with `sys.path` insertion in test file.\n\n## Test file to create\n`/workspace/evaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py`\n\nThe test file will use:\n- `pytest` + `unittest.mock` (patch, MagicMock)\n- `pytest`'s `tmp_path` fixture for real filesystem operations\n- Manual mock objects for mitmproxy types (HTTPFlow, headers)\n\n---\n\n## Test Suite Structure\n\n### 1. Pure-logic utility functions (no I/O)\n\n**`count_whitespace_stats`**\n- Empty string ‚Üí all zeros\n- String with newlines ‚Üí correct count\n- String with mul"}]}],"system":[{"type":"text","text":"x-anthropic-billing-header: cc_version=2.1.92.e65; cc_entrypoint=cli; cch=23313;"},{"type":"text","text":"You are Claude Code, Anthropic's official CLI for Claude."},{"type":"text","text":"Generate a short kebab-case name (2-4 words) that captures the main topic of this conversation. Use lowercase words separated by hyphens. Examples: \"fix-login-bug\", \"add-auth-feature\", \"refactor-api-client\", \"debug-test-failures\". Return JSON with a \"name\" field."}],"tools":[],"metadata":{"user_id":"{\"device_id\":\"3cb937bab58016b676b30e566c888151db2e1434327b28fa5838897a9aa8f329\",\"account_uuid\":\"\",\"session_id\":\"e0c014f7-15e5-4e3e-94a9-9fa83725f561\"}"},"max_tokens":32000,"temperature":1,"output_config":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"additionalProperties":false}}},"stream":true},7:headers;981:29:6:Accept,16:application/json,]31:13:Authorization,10:[REDACTED],]36:12:Content-Type,16:application/json,]51:10:User-Agent,33:claude-cli/2.1.92 (external, cli),]68:24:X-Claude-Code-Session-Id,36:e0c014f7-15e5-4e3e-94a9-9fa83725f561,]28:16:X-Stainless-Arch,5:arm64,]25:16:X-Stainless-Lang,2:js,]26:14:X-Stainless-OS,5:Linux,]40:27:X-Stainless-Package-Version,6:0.80.0,]31:23:X-Stainless-Retry-Count,1:0,]30:19:X-Stainless-Runtime,4:node,]41:27:X-Stainless-Runtime-Version,7:v24.3.0,]29:19:X-Stainless-Timeout,3:600,]173:14:anthropic-beta,150:interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14,redact-thinking-2026-02-12,context-management-2025-06-27,prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05,structured-outputs-2025-12-15,]52:41:anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access,4:true,]35:17:anthropic-version,10:2023-06-01,]26:9:x-api-key,10:[REDACTED],]14:5:x-app,3:cli,]28:10:Connection,10:keep-alive,]28:4:Host,17:api.anthropic.com,]46:15:Accept-Encoding,23:gzip, deflate, br, zstd,]25:14:Content-Length,4:2050,]]12:http_version;8:HTTP/1.1,}6:backup;0:~17:timestamp_created;18:1775474912.8162978^7:comment;0:;8:metadata;0:}6:marked;0:;9:is_replay;0:~11:intercepted;5:false!11:server_conn;4101:3:via;0:~19:timestamp_tcp_setup;18:1775474735.2804806^7:address;27:17:api.anthropic.com;3:443#]19:timestamp_tls_setup;18:1775474735.3083248^13:timestamp_end;0:~15:timestamp_start;18:1775474735.2518563^3:sni;17:api.anthropic.com;11:tls_version;7:TLSv1.3;11:cipher_list;0:]6:cipher;22:TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384;11:alpn_offers;0:]4:alpn;0:,16:certificate_list;3569:1318:-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
