PASSED [ 92%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_known_agent_color PASSED [ 93%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_unknown_agent_gets_md5_color PASSED [ 93%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_aggregates_multiple_requests PASSED [ 94%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_by_step_aggregation PASSED [ 95%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_by_model_aggregation PASSED [ 95%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_timing_wall_clock_computed PASSED [ 96%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_avg_duration_ms_computed PASSED [ 96%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_skips_dirs_without_numbered_subdirs PASSED [ 97%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_skips_non_directory_entries PASSED [ 98%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_file_ops_finalized PASSED [ 98%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_by_source_aggregated PASSED [ 99%]\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py::TestSummarizeUsage::test_read_file_whitespace_aggregated PASSED [100%]\n\n=================================== FAILURES ===================================\n____________________ TestFormatHeaders.test_regular_header _____________________\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py:481: in test_regular_header\n    assert \"content-type: application/json\" in result\nE   assert 'content-type: application/json' in \"b'content-type': b'application/json'\"\n______________ TestWriteRequest.test_creates_request_headers_txt _______________\nevaluation/usage/test_export_flows.py:562: in test_creates_request_headers_txt\n    assert \"content-type: application/json\" in content\nE   assert 'content-type: application/json' in \"POST https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages\\n\\nb'content-type': b'application/json'